# The map, its markers and the travel at any window size (QA5 Q5-E-22: on wide windows the art
# was drawn at a whole scale and the markers at a fractional one): a marker's click lands on its
# place, and the title card, a card and the tip are laid out away from home.
key m
wait 20
expect map open
shot shots/map_sizes.png
move map:athens
wait 3
click map:athens
waitfor 70 travelling no
expect place athens
click landmark:athens.parthenon
wait 20
expect info yes
shot shots/map_sizes_card.png
key escape
wait 15
expect info no
key m
wait 20
click map:corner
waitfor 70 travelling no
expect away no
quit
